    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. That's a very aggressive weighting for the alert system. \n\nWhy would it be beneficial for the app developers to design an algorithm that explicitly assumes the worst based on race, rather than just focusing on the behavior itself? Wouldn't that cause major liability and accuracy issues in the long run?",
